# Samsung Galaxy S5 Active (SC-02G / kltedcmactive) Key Layout
#
# Hardware scan codes defined in kernel DTS (msm8974pro-ac-sec-kactiveltedcm-r02.dtsi)
#

key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 116   POWER
key 172   HOME          WAKE
key 158   BACK
key 254   APP_SWITCH

# Active Key (便利キー / hot_key connected to GPIO 144)
key 252   EXPLORER      WAKE
